## 2-Minute Setup\
\
### 1. Copy Workflow File\
Create `.github/workflows/review.yml` in your repo and copy the workflow file from this repo.\
\
### 2. Add Your Token (Already Built-In!)\
The workflow uses GitHub's native `GITHUB_TOKEN` - no setup needed!\
\
### 3. Done!\
Next PR = automatic review\
\
That's literally it. No API keys, no secrets, nothing.\
\
---\
